<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">RAINGUARD · HONG KONG</view><view class="title"><view>每一次出发，</view><view>都有据可查</view></view><view class="subtitle">官方天气 · 地区观测 · 现场复核</view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="settings">连接设置</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="knowledge">官方知识库</button></view></view><picker range="{{regions}}" range-key="label" bindchange="regionChange"><view class="picker">当前地区：{{region}}　⌄</view></picker><view wx:if="{{historical}}" class="warning">部分来源正在使用历史快照。请核对下方观测时间，不能据此判断当前天气。</view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="refresh" loading="{{loading}}">更新官方数据</button></view><view class="muted">停留本页时每3分钟自动更新，也可下拉刷新。</view><view class="grid"><view class="metric"><view class="muted">地区过去一小时雨量上限</view><text class="number">{{rain}}</text><text class="unit">mm</text></view><view class="metric"><view class="muted">{{temperatureLabel}} 气温</view><text class="number">{{temperature}}</text><text class="unit">°C</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">官方警告</view><view wx:if="{{!warnings.length}}" class="muted">此份来源未列出生效警告；请同时核对来源时效。</view><view wx:for="{{warnings}}" wx:key="name" class="warning">{{item.name}}<view class="muted">{{item.time}}</view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">两小时降雨窗口</view><view class="muted">地区中心最近官方网格，每个数值对应一个30分钟累计量。过期预报不用于安排当前活动。</view><view wx:for="{{windows}}" wx:key="time" class="row"><text>{{item.time}}</text><text>{{item.value}} mm</text></view><view wx:if="{{!windows.length}}" class="empty">暂无可用网格</view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">天气展望</view><view>{{synopsis}}</view><view wx:for="{{forecast}}" wx:key="date" class="row"><view><view>{{item.date}} {{item.week}} · {{item.min}}–{{item.max}} °C</view><view class="muted">{{item.description}}</view></view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">数据来源与时效</view><view wx:for="{{sources}}" wx:key="key" class="row" bindtap="source" data-url="{{item.source}}"><view><view>{{item.name}} <text class="badge">{{item.label}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.time}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.error}}" class="danger muted">{{item.error}}</view><view class="source">点击复制官方来源</view></view></view></view><view class="tagline">数据用于课程研究与人工复核，官方警告优先。</view></view>
